This plugin's plugin-bootstrap skeleton (cordis.patch.yml registration,
index.mjs apply() shape, and the textTool wrapper around defineTool in
tools.mjs) is adapted from the OpenViking memory plugin above and modified for
the pdf2zh workflow. All other code (translation orchestration, provider
configuration, and OpenViking ingestion) is original.

Modifications to the OpenViking-derived files:
  - cordis.patch.yml  : adapted to register this plugin's tool group
  - index.mjs         : simplified apply() (no session/recall hooks)
  - tools.mjs         : textTool wrapper reused; all tool logic rewritten

